<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no, viewport-fit=cover">
    <title>单机知识库 - 离线检索系统</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #2c3e50;
            --secondary: #34495e;
            --accent: #e74c3c;
            --bg: #ecf0f1;
            --paper: #ffffff;
            --text: #333333;
            --vh: 1vh;
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }
        
        body { background-color: var(--bg); height: calc(var(--vh, 1vh) * 100); display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }

        header { background-color: var(--primary); color: white; padding: env(safe-area-inset-top) 20px 15px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); z-index: 10; flex-shrink: 0; }
        header h1 { font-size: 1.2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; }
        header p { font-size: 0.75rem; color: #bdc3c7; margin-top: 5px; }

        /* 上传控制台 */
        .console { background: var(--paper); padding: 15px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; z-index: 5; flex-shrink: 0; }
        .upload-area { border: 2px dashed #bdc3c7; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; text-align: center; cursor: pointer; transition: 0.3s; background: #f9f9f9; }
        .upload-area:active { background: #eee; }
        #file-input { display: none; }
        
        .status-bar { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #7f8c8d; margin-top: 10px; display: none; }
        .status-bar.active { display: flex; }

        /* 显示区域 */
        .viewport { flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; padding: 15px; scroll-behavior: smooth; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 15px; }

        .result-card { background: var(--paper); border-left: 4px solid var(--accent); border-radius: 6px; padding: 15px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); animation: slideIn 0.3s ease; }
        @keyframes slideIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
        
        .card-header { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--accent); font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px dashed #eee; padding-bottom: 5px; }
        .card-text { font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--text); white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-all; }
        
        /* 高亮关键词 */
        .highlight { background-color: #f1c40f; color: #000; font-weight: bold; padding: 0 2px; border-radius: 2px; }

        /* 底部搜索栏 */
        .search-bar { background: var(--paper); border-top: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px 15px calc(10px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); display: flex; gap: 10px; }
        .search-input { flex: 1; height: 44px; padding: 0 15px; border: 1px solid #ccc; border-radius: 22px; font-size: 16px; outline: none; background: #fdfdfd; }
        .search-input:focus { border-color: var(--primary); }
        .search-btn { height: 44px; padding: 0 20px; background: var(--primary); color: white; border: none; border-radius: 22px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 1rem; }

        /* 系统消息 */
        .sys-msg { text-align: center; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #95a5a6; margin: 10px 0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <h1>📖 离线知识检索器</h1>
    <p>纯本地单机版 | 无需联网 | 数据绝不外泄</p>
</header>

<div class="console">
    <div class="upload-area" onclick="document.getElementById('file-input').click()" id="upload-btn">
        <div style="font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 5px;">📥</div>
        <div style="font-weight: bold; color: var(--primary);">点击上传书籍全文 (仅限 TXT 格式)</div>
        <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: #7f8c8d; margin-top: 5px;">*请先将 Word 另存为 TXT 格式。断网环境亦可秒传。</div>
    </div>
    <input type="file" id="file-input" accept=".txt" onchange="processBook(event)">
    
    <div class="status-bar" id="status-bar">
        <span id="book-name">书籍: 无</span>
        <span id="book-stats">分段: 0 | 字数: 0</span>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="viewport" id="viewport">
    <div class="sys-msg" id="welcome-msg">请先在上方上传资料，然后开始检索。</div>
</div>

<div class="search-bar">
    <input type="text" class="search-input" id="search-input" placeholder="输入关键词 (如: 鲁迅 狂人日记)" onkeypress="if(event.key==='Enter') executeSearch()">
    <button class="search-btn" onclick="executeSearch()">检索</button>
</div>

